    "lines": [
      {
        "text": "The listing said the house had seven rooms."
      },
      {
        "text": "Nadia counted six.",
        "pauseBefore": 0.35
      },
      {
        "text": "She's an architect. She measures everything.",
        "pauseBefore": 0.3
      },
      {
        "text": "Her little brother Theo thought she was being paranoid.",
        "pauseBefore": 0.2
      },
      {
        "text": "It's an old house, Nads. Old plans are wrong.",
        "speaker": "theo",
        "pauseBefore": 0.25
      },
      {
        "text": "So she measured the hallway. Inside: four meters twenty.",
        "pauseBefore": 0.35
      },
      {
        "text": "Outside: five meters ten.",
        "pauseBefore": 0.3
      },
      {
        "text": "That's not a wall. That's a room.",
        "speaker": "nadia",
        "pauseBefore": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "That night, at 3:12, something knocked.",
        "say": "That night, at three-twelve, something knocked.",
        "pauseBefore": 0.6
      },
      {
        "text": "Three times. From inside the wall.",
        "pauseBefore": 1.7
      },
      {
        "text": "Nadia… did you hear that?",
        "speaker": "theo",
        "speed": 0.92,
        "gain": 0.8,
        "pauseBefore": 0.5
      },
      {
        "text": "In the morning, she drilled a hole into the gap.",
        "pauseBefore": 0.5
      },
      {
        "text": "Cold air came out.",
        "pauseBefore": 1.0
      },
      {
        "text": "Then, right where the drill had been, something knocked back.",
        "pauseBefore": 0.6
      },
      {
        "text": "Part two.",
        "pauseBefore": 1.0
      }
    ]
  },
